- tests/test_uso_reale_20261118.py: the ECDSA P-256 test vector of the DSSE specification
  (https://github.com/secure-systems-lab/dsse, protocol.md at tag v1.0.2, section "Test
  Vectors": public key coordinates, payload, payload type and signature), Apache-2.0,
  copied on 18 November 2026. omega_evidence/interop/sigstore.py reads the field names
